      "reviewer": "OpenAI Codex",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-08-24T12:07:16Z",
      "note": "Reviewed the exploit receipt and call trace, official post-mortem, commit-pinned reproduction, BFactory creation transaction, verified BPool source metadata, historical runtime, and historical balances. The trace repeatedly executes gulp, swapExactAmountIn, and swapExactAmountOut on BPool 0x0e511aa1a137aad267dfe3a6bfca0b856c1a3682. Its accounting credits the requested transfer amount without checking the received balance delta, allowing STA's 1% transfer fee and permissionless gulp resynchronization to corrupt the pool balance used for pricing. BFactory created this direct 22,537-byte runtime at block 10160718; its hash is 0x974df1c33872ba8aab782be5117ff348802441590f84ed7701d734bb9c21683e both at creation and immediately before exploit block 10355807, and disassembly contains no DELEGATECALL, SELFDESTRUCT, or CREATE2. Exact pool balance decreases in the exploit block are 455.846948032849336628 WETH, 11.35684364 WBTC, 22593.091001342188353163 LINK, 60915.305864698149602959 SNX, and 2396522.196928941001681855 STA."
